{
 "about": "Writes body_shapes.json: the Kangs player body as a table of shapes, shared by the Houdini builder",
 "head_about": "Head block: shapes in head-local metres (origin midway between the ear canals, +y up, +z forward), placed at origin = (0, height_m - origin_from_top, origin_z). Evaluated in list order at body point P: X = P - origin; if mirror, X.x = |X.x|; q = (X - c) * basis (row vector times row-major 3x3); if taper (tz, ty): q.x /= 1 + tz*clamp(q.z/r.z,-1,1) + ty*clamp(q.y/r.y,-1,1). kind ell: IQ ellipsoid k0*(k0-1)/k1, k0=|q/r|, k1=|q/r^2|; cone: q.z /= aspect, round cone along local +y from 0 to len, radii ra->rb; box: IQ round box, half-size r, rounding round; plane: q.z (half-space, outward normal = local +z); gauss: amp*exp(-|q/r|^2). op union: d = first ? s : smin(d, s, k); subtract: d = smax(d, -s, k); intersect: d = smax(d, s, k); add (gauss): d -= s. smin(a,b,k) = min(a,b) - h*h*k/4, h = max(k-|a-b|,0)/k; smax(a,b,k) = -smin(-a,-b,k). The body core joins the head with smin(core, head, neck_k).",
